sn12.33:2.6 | S: Knowledge of craving … | T: Knowledge of craving …
sn12.33:2.7 | S: Knowledge of feeling … | T: Knowledge of feeling …
sn12.33:2.8 | S: Knowledge of contact … | T: Knowledge of contact …
